        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wR1oySnBSbG95ZFZCWE9YYzNjRlowVVZReFkzYxAB!2m1!1s0x3404019ca2847d41:0x3a323f5b85718286"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJQX2EopwBBDQRhoJxhVs_Mjo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1Q1FUTlNOR2xuVkY5cFdraFNVV2RPU0VnNFFXYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "Wanaka是一間素食cafe, 每道菜都做得很精心及好吃，尤其是這杯黃薑豆奶，真是有特別又好飲。\n\n這間cafe設有室内和同室外的座位。食客可以坐在室外，看藍屋🏠的風景，也有一番的風味。😍🤩",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Wanaka是一間素食cafe, 每道菜都做得很精心及好吃，尤其是這杯黃薑豆奶，真是有特別又好飲。\n\n這間cafe設有室内和同室外的座位。食客可以坐在室外，看藍屋🏠的風景，也有一番的風味。😍🤩",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "地導鳥走天涯 Local Guide Bird",
